    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey. Im SUPERita <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682910/extras/5b6f980324e1271a0fe892cc3bf151a9.webp?t=1755663088\" width=15 height=20 /></span>\u00a0and I love card games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So i made a game where everything is cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and you can combine cards to create new cards (<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682910/extras/5e34689b0b66efb0cd709fc77f426dbf.webp?t=1755663088\" width=15 height=20 /></span>\u00a0+\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682910/extras/04f8030738c65cfd036d41c4fcf03b28.webp?t=1755663088\" width=15 height=20 /></span>\u00a0=\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682910/extras/35ac920120d1727080c67341db6c2720.webp?t=1755663088\" width=15 height=20 /></span>).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682910/extras/f40e4a75c2ad4f49c5fc8a5354f374cd.poster.avif?t=1755663088\" width=202 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682910/extras/f40e4a75c2ad4f49c5fc8a5354f374cd.webm?t=1755663088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >even your save file is a card\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682910/extras/b6a1093b93a6ebf4a12a601cd6ccb4f8.webp?t=1755663088\" width=15 height=20 /></span>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find cards:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you start with a deck and monsters and keys are shuffled into it at the start of every round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and after you find all keys, you go to the shop where you can buy better cards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the more card recipes you know the better chances you have to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the better combos you can make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682910/extras/8dc6b8176366f7e671cc3462119f4d7e.poster.avif?t=1755663088\" width=314 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682910/extras/8dc6b8176366f7e671cc3462119f4d7e.webm?t=1755663088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682910/extras/296e037b31b6a456cf8b5cc7716c9204.webp?t=1755663088\" width=15 height=20 /></span>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >170+ unique cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >wild combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hand drawn cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >deckbuilder roguelike love</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft weapons <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682910/extras/974543c5e62f03f6356ace65055fb1c5.webp?t=1755663088\" width=15 height=20 /></span>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you can fight off the monsters by creating weapons from the basic materials you have. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/